WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.750 --> 00:00:02.419
It's been a full on year
for me and Nikki.

00:00:02.419 --> 00:00:05.463
Ups and downs, finally
defrosted the fridge.

00:00:05.463 --> 00:00:07.090
Gave serious
consideration

00:00:07.090 --> 00:00:07.757
to starting yoga.

00:00:07.757 --> 00:00:10.260
Honestly I've never 
been closer.

00:00:10.260 --> 00:00:11.136
Also, oh yeah...

00:00:11.136 --> 00:00:12.721
it turns out we
can't have kids.

00:00:12.721 --> 00:00:14.556
So, we're gonna adopt.

00:00:14.556 --> 00:00:15.598
No!

00:00:15.598 --> 00:00:18.935
Talk to your children!

00:00:18.935 --> 00:00:21.604
They're not 
my children!

00:00:21.604 --> 00:00:22.897
Yeah that was big.

00:00:22.897 --> 00:00:23.732
It will be fine though

00:00:23.732 --> 00:00:25.275
as long as we keep
our heads.

00:00:27.026 --> 00:00:29.362
Our family is 
really encouraging.

00:00:29.362 --> 00:00:32.365
Certain things you
don't get second hand

00:00:32.365 --> 00:00:33.867
Underwear,
children.

00:00:33.867 --> 00:00:35.410
Our support network
couldn't be more 

00:00:35.410 --> 00:00:36.286
positive.

00:00:36.286 --> 00:00:37.370
My kids suck every

00:00:37.370 --> 00:00:38.413
ounce of energy
out of me

00:00:38.413 --> 00:00:40.915
until I'm nothing but
an empty carcass.

00:00:40.915 --> 00:00:41.875
And we got
approved!

00:00:41.875 --> 00:00:43.960
No bother at all,
sailed right through.

00:00:43.960 --> 00:00:45.211
Communication would
be at the top, right,

00:00:45.211 --> 00:00:46.671
And then you got 
honesty underneath it.

00:00:46.671 --> 00:00:47.464
But the 
communication

00:00:47.464 --> 00:00:49.007
sort of encompasses
both of them.

00:00:49.007 --> 00:00:49.883
Um...

00:00:49.883 --> 00:00:51.551
Actually don't worry
Nikki is eyeballing me.

00:00:51.551 --> 00:00:52.218
Right.

00:00:52.218 --> 00:00:53.470
You're up to date.

